        "id": 25880,
        "name": "Jurassic Park",
        "summary": "Jurassic Park is a top-down action-adventure game based on the blockbuster film. Players take on the role of Dr. Alan Grant, exploring the island, rescuing stranded workers, and battling escaped dinosaurs. The game features maze-like levels, limited ammo, and key-based progression, combining exploration and survival in a challenging prehistoric setting.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co2zpb.jpg",
