      {
        "id": 17249,
        "name": "Ninja Gaiden III: The Ancient Ship of Doom",
        "summary": "Thrilling new cinema screen! Follow the story of Ryu's epic adventure through Tecmo's movie-like Cinema Screen Animation. As you complete each level, a new part of the story unfolds. Exciting new powers and weapons! Over the years Ninja Ryu's fighting skills have improved to include fantastic new powers and weapons. Action-packed Ninja adventure! Can you get Ryu through his most challenging adventure as he battles the hideous ancient forces of darkness to save mankind? The Ultimate Ninja Challenge!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ips.jpg",
