      {
        "id": 7776,
        "name": "Battletoads / Double Dragon",
        "summary": "Battletoads & Double Dragon - The Ultimate Team is the fourth game in the Battletoads series. It is a crossover with the Double Dragon series of beat 'em up games developed by Technos Japan. It was released for the NES, with ports for the Super NES, Sega Mega Drive/Genesis, and Nintendo Game Boy. Despite the presence of the Double Dragon characters, Technos Japan had no actual role in the game's development.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co70dr.jpg",
